Having multiple luckstones makes no difference.  You may as well only carry
one.  Even having more than one blessed luckstone doesn't make a difference.

The intrinsics message you read was:

You are very unlucky.
You have extra luck.     <-- You are carrying an uncursed/blessed luckstone

not:

You are very unlucky.
You are lucky.           <-- A contradiction.

Only sacrificing really really *big* monsters will get your god happy again.
Try krakens.

